        "observations": "Entire1280x608 photocomposition inspected. Low inner court around a high moulded sanctuary plinth, narrow real portal/window voids, close gallery walls, stone corbel roofs and dense raised pediment rims. Crown is cropped; do not infer its whole silhouette from this picture."
